{
  "job_B14.17_20251003_114304": {
    "text": "\u00d0is is \u00feonne seo woruldcunde ger\u00e6dnes, \u00fee ic wille, \u00fe\u00e6t man ealde.\n\u00de\u00e6t is \u00feonne, \u00fe\u00e6t ic wille, \u00f0\u00e6t \u00e6lc man sy folcrihtes wyr\u00f0e, ge earm ge eadig, & him man rihte domas\n& sy on \u00fe\u00e6re bote swylc forgifnes, swylce hit for Gode gebeorglic sy & for worulde aberendlic.\n& ne gesece nan man \u00feone cyng for nanre spr\u00e6ce, butan he \u00e6t ham rihtes wyr\u00f0e beon ne mote o\u00f0\u00f0e riht\nGyf \u00fe\u00e6t riht to hefig sy, sece si\u00fe\u00fean \u00f0a lihtinge to \u00feam cynge.\n& \u00e6t nanum botwyr\u00f0um gylte ne forwyrce man mare \u00feane his wer.\n& se dema, se \u00f0e o\u00f0rum on woh gedeme, gesylle \u00feam cynge hundtwelfti scillinga to bote butan he mid\n& se \u00fee o\u00f0erne mid woge forseggan wille, \u00fe\u00e6t he a\u00feor o\u00f0\u00f0e feo o\u00f0\u00f0e feore \u00fee wyrsa sy, gyf \u00feonne se\n& sece man hundredgemot, swa hit \u00e6r geset w\u00e6s.\n& habbe man \u00feriwa on geare burhgemot & tuwa scirgemot.\n& \u00fe\u00e6r beo on \u00f0\u00e6re scire biscop & se ealdorman, & \u00fe\u00e6r \u00e6g\u00f0er t\u00e6can ge Godes riht ge woruldriht.\n& finde him \u00e6lc man, \u00fe\u00e6t he borh h\u00e6bbe; & se borh hine \u00feonne to \u00e6lcum rihte gel\u00e6de & geealde.\n& gyf hwa \u00feonne woh wyrce & uto\u00f0berste, abere se borh \u00fe\u00e6t he aberan scolde.\nGyf hit \u00feyf\u00f0 beo, & gyf he hine binnan twelf mon\u00f0um gelangian m\u00e6ge, agyfe hine to rihte, & him man\n& se \u00f0e tyhtbysig sy & folce ungetriwe & \u00feas gemot forbuge, \u00feonne sceawie man of \u00f0am gemote \u00fea \u00fee\nGyf he \u00feonne ne m\u00e6ge, gewylde man hine swa\u00f0or man m\u00e6ge, swa cwicne swa deadne; & nime man\n& gyf a\u00f0or o\u00f0\u00f0e m\u00e6g o\u00fe\u00fee fremde \u00fea rade forsace, gylde \u00feam cynge hundtwelftig scillinga.\n& gesece se \u00e6b\u00e6ra \u00f0eof \u00f0\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t he gesece, o\u00fe\u00fee se \u00f0e on hlafordsearwe gemet sie, \u00fe\u00e6t hi n\u00e6fre feorh\n& ga an mynet ofer ealne \u00fe\u00e6s cynges anweald, & \u00feane nan man ne forsace; & gemet, swylce man on\n& ga seo w\u00e6g wulle to ealfan punde, & hie nan man na deoror ne sylle.",
